{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Staying Healthy"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals for Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To give advice about things like health issues, you can use modals like <span class =\"italic\">might, may, could,</span> or <span class =\"italic\">should</span>.<br/><br/>You can also use an expression like <span class =\"italic\">would be wise to</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These modals can go at the beginning of the sentence, or after a clause starting with <span class =\"italic\">\u201cIf ... \u201d</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modal is followed by a verb in the base form. You do not use \u201cto\u201d. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Children should not be forced to empty their plates."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Parents should encourage their children to eat only until they are satisfied."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Conditional Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else may or will (not) happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class =\"italic\">If</span> (or when) clause and the <span class =\"italic\">Condition</span> clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class =\"italic\">If</span> or <span class =\"italic\">When</span> clause can go at the start or the end of the sentence."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1st Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">2nd Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If overeating is already a problem,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"people should change their way of eating instead of dieting. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible overeating is already a problem. In this condition: people should change their way of eating instead of dieting.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"People not only lose weight but keep it off \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when they change their eating habits.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible people change their eating habits. In this condition: they not only lose weight but keep it off.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If overeating is already a problem, people should change their way of eating instead of dieting."}, {"type": "example", "content": "People not only lose weight but keep it off when they change their eating habits. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overeating"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "eating more than you need"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Mothers should be careful about their children overeating."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about healthy eating habits."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "habit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you are used to doing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Overeating is a bad habit."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to encourage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to help; to promote"}, {"type": "part_speech", "c